6.Which value of margin is used to center a block element horizontally within its container?
a)center
b)middle
C)auto
D)0



✅ Correct Answer: margin: 0 auto;

Simple English:

To center a block element horizontally, use:

margin: 0 auto;
0 = No top and bottom margin.
auto = Left and right margins become equal, so the element is centered.
Example:
.box {
  width: 200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

👉 The .box will be centered horizontally inside its parent.

Easy Remember:
auto = Center
margin: 0 auto; = Horizontal center

✅ Final Answer: margin: 0 auto;



